  "prefLabel": "Pda 602.02 Pier Use Permit Required for Charter Boat",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 602.02 Pier Use Permit Required for Charter Boat. No charter boat shall be secured to a recreational-use pier unless a pier use permit has been issued to the owner or operator of the charter boat for the charter boat by the division under Pda 600.\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13; ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
